Modifications by RyukSign (2025–2026)
-------------------------------------
RyukSign began from Feather and adds substantial new functionality while
preserving the upstream signing core. Files carrying the original
"Created by samara" header that have been modified by the RyukSign project,
and the new files added by it, are part of these changes. The principal
additions and changes are:

  - Tweak Manager: import/organize/inject .dylib, .deb, .framework, .bundle,
    and .appex tweaks (RyukSign/Backend/Observable/TweakManager.swift,
    RyukSign/Utilities/Handlers/Tweak*.swift, RyukSign/Views/Tweaks/*).
  - Web Manager / File Transfer server over HTTP and WebDAV
    (RyukSign/Backend/Server/*, RyukSign/Backend/Observable/WebManager.swift,
    RyukSign/Views/Settings/Web Manager/*).
  - Enhanced download manager with Live Activities and a download overlay
    (RyukSign/Backend/Observable/DownloadManager.swift, RyukSign/Views/Download/*).
  - RyukSign branding, curated repositories, and premium-source support
    (RyukSign/Utilities/RyukSignAPI.swift, RyukSign/Views/Sources/*).
  - App update checker with per-app ignored/skipped updates
    (RyukSign/Backend/Observable/AppUpdateChecker.swift,
    RyukSign/Backend/Observable/SkippedUpdatesManager.swift,
    RyukSign/Views/Settings/Updates/*).
  - Configurable tab bar, toast notification system, file logging, and
    assorted UX additions (RyukSign/Views/Common/*, RyukSign/Utilities/FileLogger.swift,
    RyukSign/Backend/Observable/TabBarPreferences.swift).
  - Decompression and source-list performance fixes over upstream
    (RyukSign/Utilities/ARDecompression/Decompression.swift,
    RyukSign/Views/Sources/Apps/UIKit/SourceAppsTableRepresentableView.swift).

For the exact set of changes, compare this repository against the upstream
Feather repository, or consult the project commit history.

